s your friends.<br>Bring back your favorite cards and collect them!<br>They will help you in your adventures.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642620/extras/1103d0b50af57ecffb0c7c2c4c793417.avif?t=1742370447\" width=624 height=352 /></span><br><strong>Unused cards on the field can also help you!<br>Decide which cards to use and which cards to keep!\ud83d\udd25</strong>",
